pying lmao","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:46:39.426222+00:00"},{"id":871,"body":"yep","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:46:47.06628+00:00"},{"id":872,"body":"Where are those rules?","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:47:02.115189+00:00"},{"id":873,"body":"I am tracking all the top repos and who copied who and will have my work available if the mods want it","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:47:14.481371+00:00"},{"id":874,"body":"Appreciate it <3","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:47:30.87004+00:00"},{"id":875,"body":"Do you have a way to talk to the mods? I have a question and the email isn't getting a response","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:47:48.347275+00:00"},{"id":876,"body":"no clue, they were in chat at the start and probably will be towards the end","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:48:27.761329+00:00"},{"id":877,"body":"mods if you are here look at the email pleasee","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:48:51.546445+00:00"},{"id":878,"body":"@NefertitiQueen500 Are most of the top people like that rn?","face":"darwin-4","staff":false,"author":"FinchChuck2001","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:49:12.438642+00:00"},{"id":879,"body":"like copying each other lol","face":"darwin-4","staff":false,"author":"FinchChuck2001","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:49:16.944443+00:00"},{"id":880,"body":"yeah nefertiti I would love to see your work I want to see whos copying who","face":"lincoln-4","staff":false,"author":"HonestAbe314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:49:32.346213+00:00"},{"id":881,"body":"I think so, you take someone elses work and compare against your own, keep the good from both and score a little better","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:50:07.309379+00:00"},{"id":882,"body":"\"One team a person, and your own team's repository. No sharing code between teams: top entries are compared, and you may be asked to explain yours. A submission with the same repository, commit or archive as another team's is disqualified, the later one.\"","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:50:51.722289+00:00"},{"id":883,"body":"is that happening for all tracks?","face":"archimedes-2","staff":false,"author":"EurekaArchie3000","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:50:57.717577+00:00"},{"id":884,"body":"verbatim on the blast radius page","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:51:03.226722+00:00"},{"id":885,"body":"is shopping sessions track having similar issues with lots of forking?","face":"darwin-4","staff":false,"author":"FinchChuck2001","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:52:22.815562+00:00"},{"id":886,"body":"yeah was wondering about blast radius as well","face":"archimedes-2","staff":false,"author":"EurekaArchie3000","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:52:56.495985+00:00"},{"id":887,"body":"I think most definitely, especially if you just let an agent loose and tell it to maximize score, mine tried to clone a top repo before I stopped it","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:52:59.901793+00:00"},{"id":888,"body":"im doing the cad one because i think the risk of \"forking\" is significantly less since theres no github. but its kinda a monster to submit","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:53:11.887347+00:00"},{"id":889,"body":"@ChopinBlock314 I wish mine would finish downloading lol","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:54:27.891428+00:00"},{"id":890,"body":"whats yours at?","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:54:59.528042+00:00"},{"id":891,"body":"hi","face":"suntzu-2","staff":false,"author":"SunTzuPlan64","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:13.050578+00:00"},{"id":892,"body":"almost done, then need to rerun all the files above windows char limit","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:21.355451+00:00"},{"id":893,"body":"im a student from singapore","face":"suntzu-2","staff":false,"author":"SunTzuPlan64","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:30.872349+00:00"},{"id":894,"body":"so not even close to done","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:32.765096+00:00"},{"id":895,"body":"rip","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:47.416581+00:00"},{"id":896,"body":"@SunTzuPlan64 what's up","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:55:50.776434+00:00"},{"id":897,"body":"fellow nefertitqueen where you from, friend","face":"nefertiti-4","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen418","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:25.442287+00:00"},{"id":898,"body":"US","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:59.646123+00:00"},{"id":899,"body":"Where in US tho bro we're a big country","face":"alexander-2","staff":false,"author":"AlexTheGreat7164","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:58:33.362702+00:00"},{"id":900,"body":"anyone from upstate NY?","face":"pythagoras-1","staff":false,"author":"PythagorasRule6818","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:02.117392+00:00"},{"id":901,"body":"multitasking this and work right now, 5 paseo tabs open and just burning millions of tokens","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:19.07224+00:00"},{"id":902,"body":"i am","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:20.63156+00:00"},{"id":903,"body":"@PythagorasRule6818","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:27.625105+00:00"},{"id":904,"body":"where are you rn","face":"pythagoras-1","staff":false,"author":"PythagorasRule6818","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:44.530628+00:00"},{"id":905,"body":"Albany","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T03:59:49.944765+00:00"},{"id":906,"body":"wbu","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:00:05.797684+00:00"},{"id":907,"body":"rochester","face":"pythagoras-1","staff":false,"author":"PythagorasRule6818","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:00:05.983888+00:00"},{"id":908,"body":"US is fine ig given how many intl ppl there are, nice to meet u bro","face":"nefertiti-4","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen418","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:01:17.994769+00:00"},{"id":909,"body":"how did you guys find out about this. My school basically sent out a mass email","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"author":"ChopinBlock314","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:01:39.692707+00:00"},{"id":910,"body":"same bro","face":"pythagoras-1","staff":false,"author":"PythagorasRule6818","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:01:54.801966+00:00"},{"id":911,"body":"I'm in cyber so I would rather not reveal more","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:02:00.75817+00:00"},{"id":912,"body":"There's a 5th prize of 250 for making a video, should I do an expose on all the top teams cheating off each other lol, that sounds kind of fun","face":"nefertiti-2","staff":false,"author":"NefertitiQueen500","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:03:48.878507+00:00"},{"id":913,"body":"great idea","face":"archimedes-2","staff":false,"author":"EurekaArchie3000","created_at":"2026-11-21T04:04:16.82943+00:00"},{"id":914,"body":"i think that would be good too","face":"chopin-3","staff":false,"au